Phase 2 – Interactivity Layer
Reports Page Enhancement
1. Project Overview

Phase 1 delivered:

Data preview

Transformation pipeline

Chart customization

Multi-chart dashboard

Layout persistence

Phase 2 introduces interactive analytics capabilities, including:

Global filters (Slicers)

Cross-filtering between charts

Drill-down (hierarchical navigation)

Chart-level filters

This phase must significantly improve dashboard interactivity and user exploration capabilities.

2. Scope of Phase 2

This phase includes implementation of:

